Package: ClassifyMe
Title: Standardise and classify metabolites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ryan", "Lester", , "r.lester@griffith.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Standardises metabolite names from CAS, LIPID-MAPS and HMDB identifiers, then classifies them for biological context. Designed to work with Agilent MassHunter Explorer outputs.
